  - TextToDisplay: 'The year is 1934, just one year after the prohibition. '
    ActiveTime: 5
  - TextToDisplay: ' You are Thomas Sencher and 8 years ago your wife, Ruth, was
      last seen in the Devils Strait.'
    ActiveTime: 6
  - TextToDisplay: She has not been heard from since.
    ActiveTime: 5
  - TextToDisplay: 'You have but one goal: find Ruth Sencher.'
    ActiveTime: 5
